# DrawFile's messages, in TAIRiX Bridge's own words.
NotDraw:This is not a Draw file
Version:The file is version %0 of the Draw format, later than DrawFile reads
FontTables:The file holds a second font table (at &%0 in the file)
NoFont:Font number %0 is missing from the file's font table (at &%1 in the file)
TooBig:An object is larger than the file
TooBigAt:An object is larger than the file (after &%0 in the file)
TooBigGroup:An object is larger than its group (after &%0 in the file)
TooBigTagged:An object is larger than its tagged object (after &%0 in the file)
AreaCommand:The text area holds \%0, which is no command
AreaFont:The text area changes to font number %0 before defining it
AreaVersion:The text area is version %0, which DrawFile does not read
AreaNoVersion:The text area does not begin with its version
